PASTE_YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE

HOW TO USE (for Dari):
1. Copy this file to: maps-key.txt
2. Open maps-key.txt, delete this whole text, and paste ONLY your real
   Google Maps API key (no quotes, no spaces around it).
3. Every time you unpack a new Fyft zip: copy maps-key.txt next to .env
   into the new folder — before eas build.
4. NEVER commit maps-key.txt to git (it is gitignored). The example file
   stays as documentation.
